استورد std.text.compare;
استورد std.text.from_bytes;
استورد compiler.diagnostics.identity;
استورد compiler.diagnostics.registry;

// Wire-identity regression: every public diagnostic keeps its public code and
// its machine kind ("id" and "kind" in JSON), in registry order. A renamed,
// renumbered, removed or reordered code fails here; a new code is added at
// the end of both lists on purpose (docs/en/reference/diagnostics.md).
